  "slug": "route-schematic",
  "title": "Route schematic",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 23,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The stops of one trip on a line: the part already travelled in the accent, the vehicle where it is now, and the place and time under each stop. A diagram, not a map, so it stays honest and readable at any width.",
    "id": "Pemberhentian satu perjalanan di sebuah garis: bagian yang sudah ditempuh berwarna aksen, kendaraan di posisinya sekarang, dan tempat serta waktu di bawah setiap pemberhentian. Diagram, bukan peta, sehingga tetap jujur dan terbaca di lebar berapa pun."
  },
  "titleId": "Route schematic",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A flight under way",
        "desc": "Air freight from Jakarta to Singapore, 65 % of the way. The arc draws in once, then the plane settles on it, turned along the curve.",
        "html": "<div class=\"route\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" data-lds-route='{\"label\":\"Air freight from Jakarta to Singapore, 65 percent of the way, landing at 08:45.\",\"mode\":\"flight\",\"position\":0.65,\"stops\":[{\"name\":\"Jakarta CGK\",\"sub\":\"Left 06:10\"},{\"name\":\"Singapore SIN\",\"sub\":\"Lands 08:45\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A road trip with stops",
        "desc": "Four stops by truck. Passed stops fill, the next one is marked in the accent, and the words under each say when.",
        "html": "<div class=\"route\" style=\"max-width: 640px;\" data-lds-route='{\"label\":\"Road freight from Bandung to Yogyakarta, past Tasikmalaya, next stop Purwokerto.\",\"mode\":\"road\",\"position\":1.4,\"stops\":[{\"name\":\"Bandung\",\"sub\":\"Loaded 15 Nov, 21:00\"},{\"name\":\"Tasikmalaya\",\"sub\":\"Passed 16 Nov, 01:40\"},{\"name\":\"Purwokerto\",\"sub\":\"Due 06:30\"},{\"name\":\"Yogyakarta\",\"sub\":\"Due 10:15\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Narrow: vertical",
        "desc": "In a narrow column the same route runs down the left, so long place names never squeeze. A delivered route has no vehicle; every stop is filled.",
        "html": "<div class=\"route\" style=\"max-width: 300px;\" data-lds-route='{\"label\":\"Sea freight from Tanjung Priok to Singapore, delivered.\",\"mode\":\"sea\",\"position\":2,\"stops\":[{\"name\":\"Tanjung Priok, Jakarta\",\"sub\":\"Sailed 13 Nov, 18:00\"},{\"name\":\"Batam anchorage\",\"sub\":\"Passed 15 Nov, 07:20\"},{\"name\":\"Port of Singapore\",\"sub\":\"Delivered 15 Nov, 21:15\"}]}'></div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"route\" data-lds-route='{\"label\":\"Sea freight from Tanjung Priok to Singapore, delivered.\",\"mode\":\"sea\",\"position\":2,\"stops\":[{\"name\":\"Tanjung Priok, Jakarta\",\"sub\":\"Sailed 13 Nov, 18:00\"},{\"name\":\"Batam anchorage\",\"sub\":\"Passed 15 Nov, 07:20\"},{\"name\":\"Port of Singapore\",\"sub\":\"Delivered 15 Nov, 21:15\"}]}'></div>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { drawRoute } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  // the truck reported a new position: the travelled part and the vehicle move there\n  drawRoute(el, { ...config, position: 1.8 });\n</script>"
      }
    ],
